# REACH: the owner's stretch target as an operator. A5 (18 Nov 2026): 10x below the market's best setup.
# Measured: the assembly line (X5) reached 3.7x on S1 (0.268 of B1, api basis) and 2.8x on S2; the limit is thinking.
LANGUAGE RSOS 0.2
WORLD economy
HOST agents KIND software CHANNELS visual
USE HOST agents
OBJECT cost KIND module
PART cost.task KIND measure
REACH cost10 ON cost.task TARGET 10 AGAINST market_best MEASURE cost_per_task RESULT 3.7 LIMIT thinking BLOCKERS thinking, audit_calls, grammar_per_call
DEFICIT cost.task.thinking 0.87
PARTICLE thermostat LAND cost.task.thinking ON effort OPENS escalate_on_reject
PARTICLE acceptance_sampling LAND cost.task.audit_calls ON risk_ops OPENS audit_by_equality
REACH cost10b ON cost.task TARGET 10 AGAINST market_best_low_thinking MEASURE cost_per_task FROM cost10 BLOCKERS thinking, auditor_errors
